^{:go/end 1017} (go/func PutAttrs "PutAttrs writes the attributes for a DIE to symbol 's'.\n\nNote that we can (and do) add arbitrary attributes to a DIE, but\nonly the ones actually listed in the Abbrev will be written out.\n" [^Context ctxt ^Sym s ^int abbrev ^{:tag (* DWAttr)} attr]
